{{Short description|Football tournament group stage}}
{{Use dmy dates|date=June 2018}}
Group 5 was one of six groups of national teams competing in the group stage of the [[1982 FIFA World Cup]]. Play began on 16 June and ended on 25 June 1982.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.rsssf.org/tables/82full.html |title=World Cup 1982 finals |publisher=[[RSSSF]] |access-date=30 April 2026}}</ref> The group consisted of four teams: Seeded team and host nation [[Spain national football team|Spain]], World Cup debutants [[Honduras national football team|Honduras]], [[Yugoslavia national football team|Yugoslavia]] and [[Northern Ireland national football team|Northern Ireland]].

