===Spain vs Yugoslavia===
This was the fourth time that Yugoslavia lost to the host nation of tournament, after [[Uruguay national football team|Uruguay]] in [[1930 FIFA World Cup knockout stage#Uruguay vs Yugoslavia|1930]], [[Chile national football team|Chile]] in [[1962 FIFA World Cup knockout stage#Match for third place|1962]] and [[Germany national football team|West Germany]] in [[1974 FIFA World Cup Group B#West Germany vs Yugoslavia|1974]].

